  "Planned expenses are not recorded transactions": ["Los gastos previstos no son transacciones registradas", "计划支出不是已记录的交易", "Despesas planejadas não são transações registradas", "Les dépenses prévues ne sont pas des transactions enregistrées", "Плановые расходы не являются записанными операциями"],
  "Actual plan vs 50/30/20 guideline": ["Plan real frente a la guía 50/30/20", "实际计划与 50/30/20 指引对比", "Plano real versus referência 50/30/20", "Plan réel et règle indicative 50/30/20", "Фактический план и ориентир 50/30/20"],
